---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Personal Automation Toolkit">
  <div class="shell page">
    <div class="kicker">// PROJECT 03 · IN PROGRESS</div>
    <h1>Personal Automation Toolkit.</h1>
    <p class="page-intro">A small collection of local utilities for repetitive research, data handling, job-search tasks, and developer workflows.</p>
    <div class="article"><div class="prose">
      <h2>Why</h2>
      <p>Small repeated tasks become expensive when they are done manually every week. The goal is to keep useful automation local, understandable, and easy to maintain.</p>
      <h2>Principles</h2>
      <ul><li>Prefer small scripts over giant abstractions.</li><li>Keep inputs and outputs inspectable.</li><li>Automate the boring parts without hiding the important decisions.</li></ul>
      <h2>Stack</h2>
      <div class="tags"><span class="tag">Python</span><span class="tag">Git</span><span class="tag">Linux</span></div>
    </div></div>
  </div>
</Base>
